Emoji artwork

  The SVG files are from Google's Noto Emoji,
  https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji, folder 2D/svg, at the commit
  named in UPSTREAM_COMMIT.txt. Copyright 2013 Google, Inc. Licensed under
  the Apache License, Version 2.0; LICENSE-noto-emoji.txt has the notice of
  that folder (2D/svg/LICENSE) and the text of the license.

  What EmOji-san changed (Apache License 2.0, section 4b):
  - It includes part of the files. Skin-tone variants are left out, and
    country flags are not in that folder.
  - It renamed the files from code points (emoji_u1f3ea.svg) to names
    (convenience_store.svg) and sorted them into one folder per category.
  - It did not change the content of any SVG file.

Names and categories

  The file names, the English names in index.csv and the categories follow
